 &lt;h1 class="display-1"&gt;
 Hi! I&amp;#39;m Magnus
 &lt;/h1&gt;
 &lt;h2 class="display-5"&gt;
 &lt;span&gt;"Practi-techno Academico"&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/h2&gt;
 &lt;div class="lead"&gt;
 I work as an Associate Professor at Roskilde University where I get to design and develop; new tech and people-focused tools for practitioners; server infrastructure for local InfoSec projects; local LLM testing and Open Source Enterprise tools.&lt;/br&gt; The &lt;em&gt;best part&lt;/em&gt; is that I get to &lt;code&gt;publish my results&lt;/code&gt;! &lt;/br&gt; Often I get the notion that I am way more practical than academics and more academic than practitioners, but I do see opportunity for growth in both aspects whenever I take a hands-on approach with research projects in practice.
 &lt;/div&gt;
 
